<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>SaaS Landing Page Structure</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>SaaS Landing Page Structure</h1>
<h2>Navigation</h2>
<p>{{ logo }} — [minimal nav: 1 link max] — {{ cta_button }}</p>
<h2>Hero (above the fold)</h2>
<p>Headline: [Outcome] + [Timeframe] + {{ without_pain_point }} (6-12 words) Subheadline: Expand on headline, add specificity (1-2 sentences) CTA button: {{ action_verb }} + [outcome] (e.g., &quot;Start Free Trial&quot;, &quot;Get Early Access&quot;) Visual: Product screenshot or dashboard showing the core value Social proof line: &quot;Trusted by X,000+ {{ icp_descriptor }}&quot; — placed directly below CTA button</p>
<h2>Logos (B2B only)</h2>
<p>4-6 recognizable customer logos</p>
<h2>Problem Section</h2>
<p>{{ pain_point_headline }} [Consequence 1 — with number if possible] [Consequence 2 — with number if possible] [Transition: &quot;There's a better way.&quot;]</p>
<h2>Solution</h2>
<p>&quot;Introducing {{ product }}&quot; {{ benefit_1 }} — {{ icon }} {{ benefit_2 }} — {{ icon }} {{ benefit_3 }} — {{ icon }} (Benefits, not features. Use &quot;So what?&quot; test on every feature.)</p>
<h2>How It Works</h2>
<p>Step 1: {{ user_action }} ({{ time }}) Step 2: {{ product_action }} (automatic) Step 3: {{ user_outcome }} (instant)</p>
<h2>Features</h2>
<p>6 features in 2x3 grid: {{ icon }} + [title] + [1-sentence benefit description]</p>
<h2>Testimonials</h2>
<p>3 testimonials with real photos. Format: &quot;{{ specific_result }} in [timeframe]. Before {{ product }}, I struggled with {{ problem }}. Now {{ positive_outcome }}.&quot; — {{ full_name }}, [Title] at {{ company }}</p>
<h2>Pricing (optional)</h2>
<p>3 tiers max. Highlight recommended tier. Show annual savings. Money-back guarantee badge.</p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p>5-7 conversion objections (not usage questions):</p>
<ul><li>Can I cancel anytime?</li><li>Is my data secure?</li><li>Do you offer refunds?</li><li>How is this different from {{ competitor }}?</li><li>Do I need a credit card to start?</li></ul>
<h2>Final CTA</h2>
<p>{{ benefit_reminder_headline }} [CTA button — same text as hero] [Risk reversal: 30-day money-back / no credit card / free trial]</p>
<h2>Footer (minimal)</h2>
<p>[Links: Privacy, Terms, Contact]</p>
</body></html>
